 the revelation to light when  hiccup sees light fury approaching him  in the sky he thinks that she's finally  chosen to join them so imagine his big  surprise when she grabs him by the  shoulders and sends him hurtling towards  the ground her actions caused the other  Vikings to share a big laugh but hiccup  is definitely not laughing it's here  that we realized that toothless has a  choice to make he could fly away and  live a happy life with light fury or  save hiccup and go back to Berk he  chooses to save his pal but not before  giving light fury a special look it's  clear that toothless is super faithful  to hiccup and let's just say that the  feeling is mutual  hiccups realization we hope you have  some tissues on hand because this scene  is sure to invoke a waterfall of Tears  it's old news that toothless is the king  of dragons he's taken down two alphas  and has quite the reputation  when hiccup and Astrid tried to save  toothless from the hidden world they  quickly realized that toothless is  somewhat of a celebrity there on top of  that they also realized that the hidden  world is the real dragon utopia  toothless takes his place at the top and  light fury sweetly nuzzled him while  showing him off to the rest of the  Dragons  toothless looks happier than ever which  is a hard truth for hiccup to swallow  for the first time he finds out that his  dragon can be happy without him and the  look of realization on his face hit us  right in the fields one by one all of  the dragons start bowing down to their  new king toothless is to the hidden  world what hiccup is to Berk and both  kingdoms neither chief with them at all  times  all this time hiccup thought that light  fury would come live on Berk with  toothless only to realize that it was  the other way around the final goodbye  the majority of pee  who watched How to Train Your Dragon 3  the hidden world had nothing but good  things to say however they did mention  that the threequel was super emotional 